Package: jmvReport
Type: Package
Title: AI Report Writer for jamovi (APA Method and Results Text)
Version: 0.2.1
Authors@R:
    person(given = "Fikret Bartu", family = "Yurdacan", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "fbartuyurdacan@trakya.edu.tr")
Description: Writes English APA-style Method and Results paragraphs for
    analyses performed in jamovi. Reads analyses stored in a saved jamovi
    (.omv) file, recomputes supported results, and generates report text with a
    deterministic template engine. Optional AI interpretation and wording
    improvement can use Ollama, a managed llama.cpp runtime, the OpenAI API
    shortcut, or a user-configured OpenAI-compatible server. Statistical values are generated
    deterministically and AI-reworded text is checked against the computed
    results. Wrapper analyses provide report text directly below their tables.
License: GPL-3
Encoding: UTF-8
